# Paired Secondary Route: Fishing + Cooking 1-300 (WoW: Forever)
# Follows docs/MULTI_PROFESSION_RULES.md:
# - Dedicated per-combination file: guides/pairs/fishing-cooking.guide
# - Single-anchor sections on Cooking (crafting anchor) in rising order so
#   Polestar's section auto-skip and remaining-material subtraction work
#   with 0 lint warnings; Fishing steps are interleaved inside each bracket.
# - Every `collect ... gather Fishing <rank>` has a matching `auction` goal
#   in the same section so Mix / Gather / Buy modes all work cleanly.
# - All NPC, item, spell, quest, and coordinate IDs are verified against
#   the Forever client data (build 1.60.1).

guide forever-professions/pair-fishing-cooking
title Fishing + Cooking 1-300
category Professions
folder Paired Routes
coords era
levels 1-60
zone Azeroth
keywords fishing, cooking, paired, secondary, fish, well fed, camp
pitch Level Fishing and Cooking together from 1 to 300 using zero primary profession slots.
pro Catch 100% of your Cooking ingredients while leveling Fishing
pro Unlocks +5% kill XP Well Fed food and the +8% all-stats Fishing Bowl camp feature
con Takes longer than buying fish off the Auction House

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Apprentice

section Cooking 1-50

step Learn Fishing and Buy Gear
  only Alliance
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip Both Fishing and Cooking are secondary professions and use zero primary slots. Learn Apprentice Fishing from Lee Brown at Crystal Lake, buy a Fishing Pole and 3 Shiny Baubles, and grab Recipe: Brilliant Smallfish from Tharynn Bouden in Goldshire (or Catherine Leland in Stormwind).
  train Fishing Apprentice npc 1651
  buy 6256 x1 nearest
  buy 6529 x3 nearest

step Learn Fishing and Buy Gear
  only Horde
  zone Mulgore
  tip Both Fishing and Cooking are secondary professions and use zero primary slots. Learn Apprentice Fishing from Uthan Stillwater at Stonebull Lake, buy a Fishing Pole and 3 Shiny Baubles, and grab Recipe: Brilliant Smallfish from Harn Longcast in Bloodhoof Village (or Sewa Mistrunner in Thunder Bluff).
  train Fishing Apprentice npc 5938
  buy 6256 x1 nearest
  buy 6529 x3 nearest

step Learn Cooking
  only Alliance
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Learn Apprentice Cooking from Stephen Ryback in Stormwind and pick up Recipe: Brilliant Smallfish nearby. Cooked food grants +5% kill XP while Well Fed in WoW: Forever.
  train Cooking Apprentice npc 5482
  buy 6325 x1 nearest

step Learn Cooking
  only Horde
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip Learn Apprentice Cooking from Aska Mistrunner in Thunder Bluff and pick up Recipe: Brilliant Smallfish nearby. Cooked food grants +5% kill XP while Well Fed in WoW: Forever.
  train Cooking Apprentice npc 3026
  buy 6325 x1 nearest

step Fish to 75 (Crystal Lake)
  only Alliance
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip Fish Crystal Lake to Fishing 75. Keep every Raw Brilliant Smallfish (~45) and Raw Longjaw Mud Snapper (~30) for Cooking.
  goto 47.6,62.3 map 1429 "Crystal Lake" r 25
  skill Fishing 75

step Fish to 75 (Stonebull Lake)
  only Horde
  zone Mulgore
  tip Fish Stonebull Lake to Fishing 75. Keep every Raw Brilliant Smallfish (~45) and Raw Longjaw Mud Snapper (~30) for Cooking.
  goto 44.2,63.8 map 1412 "Stonebull Lake" r 25
  skill Fishing 75

step Journeyman Fishing
  only Alliance
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip Train Journeyman Fishing (cap 150) at skill 50 and level 10 before fishing capital city waters to 130.
  level 10
  train Fishing Journeyman npc 1651

step Journeyman Fishing
  only Horde
  zone Mulgore
  tip Train Journeyman Fishing (cap 150) at skill 50 and level 10 before fishing capital city waters to 130.
  level 10
  train Fishing Journeyman npc 5938

step Fish to 130 (Stormwind Canals)
  only Alliance
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Fish the Stormwind canals to 130. Keep your Raw Brilliant Smallfish, Raw Longjaw Mud Snapper, and Raw Bristle Whisker Catfish. Pick up Recipe: Bristle Whisker Catfish from Catherine Leland and 20 Alterac Swiss from Ben Trias for later.
  goto 55.0,69.7 live map 1453 "Stormwind canals" r 25
  skill Fishing 130

step Fish to 130 (Thunder Bluff Pond)
  only Horde
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip Fish the Thunder Bluff pond to 130. Keep your Raw Brilliant Smallfish, Raw Longjaw Mud Snapper, and Raw Bristle Whisker Catfish. Pick up Recipe: Bristle Whisker Catfish from Naal Mistrunner while here.
  goto 56.1,46.4 map 1456 "Thunder Bluff pond" r 25
  skill Fishing 130

step Brilliant Smallfish: Auction House
  tip Auction House fallback for 65 Raw Brilliant Smallfish if you are buying materials instead of fishing.
  auction 6291 x65

step Brilliant Smallfish: Gather
  tip You should already hold ~65 Raw Brilliant Smallfish from Fishing 1-130 (or pull them from your bank).
  collect 6291 x65 anywhere gather Fishing 1

step Cook Brilliant Smallfish (1-50)
  tip Cook Brilliant Smallfish at a campfire or hearth to reach Cooking 50.
  learn 7751 "Brilliant Smallfish"
  craft 7751 "Brilliant Smallfish" until 50

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Journeyman

section Cooking 50-100

step Journeyman Cooking
  only Alliance
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Train Journeyman Cooking (cap 150) from Stephen Ryback and buy Recipe: Longjaw Mud Snapper nearby.
  train Cooking Journeyman npc 5482
  buy 6328 x1 nearest

step Journeyman Cooking
  only Horde
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip Train Journeyman Cooking (cap 150) from Aska Mistrunner and buy Recipe: Longjaw Mud Snapper nearby.
  train Cooking Journeyman npc 3026
  buy 6328 x1 nearest

step Longjaw Mud Snapper: Auction House
  tip Auction House fallback for 90 Raw Longjaw Mud Snapper.
  auction 6289 x90

step Longjaw Mud Snapper: Gather
  tip Caught during your 1-130 fishing brackets (or from your bank).
  collect 6289 x90 anywhere gather Fishing 1

step Cook Longjaw Mud Snapper (50-100)
  tip Cook Longjaw Mud Snapper to Cooking 100. Save any leftovers—the recipe stays yellow to 110.
  learn 7753 "Longjaw Mud Snapper"
  craft 7753 "Longjaw Mud Snapper" until 100

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Expert

section Cooking 100-175

step Expert Fishing and Booty Bay Recipes
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip Buy Expert Fishing - The Bass and You from Old Man Heming on the lowest Booty Bay dock (needs Fishing 125, level 20). While in Booty Bay, buy Recipe: Mithril Head Trout and Recipe: Filet of Redgill from Kelsey Yance for your later Cooking brackets.
  level 20
  train Fishing Expert npc 2626
  buy 17062 x1 npc 2664
  buy 13941 x1 npc 2664

step Expert Cooking and Fish to 205 (Mystral Lake)
  only Alliance
  zone Ashenvale
  tip Buy the Expert Cookbook and 7 Nightcrawlers from Shandrina at Mystral Lake (read the cookbook once Cooking reaches 125). Attach Nightcrawlers and fish Mystral Lake to Fishing 205 to stock Raw Bristle Whisker Catfish.
  level 20
  train Cooking Expert npc 3955
  buy 6530 x7 nearest
  goto 49.5,67.1 map 1440 "Mystral Lake" r 25
  skill Fishing 205

step Expert Cooking (Shadowprey Village)
  only Horde
  zone Desolace
  tip Buy the Expert Cookbook from Wulan in Shadowprey Village (read it at Cooking 125). Grab 20 Alterac Swiss from Innkeeper Sikewa for the Artisan Cooking quest later.
  level 20
  train Cooking Expert npc 12033

step Fish to 205 (Mirkfallon Lake)
  only Horde
  zone Stonetalon Mountains
  tip Buy 7 Nightcrawlers from Kulwia at Sun Rock Retreat, attach one, and fish Mirkfallon Lake to Fishing 205 to stock Raw Bristle Whisker Catfish.
  buy 6530 x7 nearest
  goto 47.6,40.1 map 1442 "Mirkfallon Lake" r 25
  skill Fishing 205

step Bristle Whisker Catfish: Recipe
  tip Pick up Recipe: Bristle Whisker Catfish if you did not buy it while fishing in your capital city.
  buy 6330 x1 nearest

step Bristle Whisker Catfish: Auction House
  tip Auction House fallback for 175 Raw Bristle Whisker Catfish.
  auction 6308 x175

step Bristle Whisker Catfish: Gather
  tip Stocked from Fishing 75-205 (or from your bank).
  collect 6308 x175 anywhere gather Fishing 75

step Longjaw Mud Snapper Top-Up
  tip Top up to Cooking 100 if needed before learning Bristle Whisker Catfish.
  craft 7753 "Longjaw Mud Snapper" until 100

step Cook Bristle Whisker Catfish (100-175)
  tip Cook Bristle Whisker Catfish to Cooking 175. Read your Expert Cookbook at 125 so skill points keep advancing past 150.
  learn 7755 "Bristle Whisker Catfish"
  craft 7755 "Bristle Whisker Catfish" until 175

section Cooking 175-225

step Fish to 225 (Dustwallow Marsh Swamp)
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip Fish the inland swamp (not the ocean!) to Fishing 225 with Nightcrawlers active. Keep every Raw Mithril Head Trout you catch.
  goto 48.2,36.5 map 1445 "Dustwallow Marsh swamp" r 25
  skill Fishing 225

step Mithril Headed Trout: Auction House
  tip Auction House fallback for 60 Raw Mithril Head Trout.
  auction 8365 x60

step Mithril Headed Trout: Gather
  tip Caught in Dustwallow Marsh swamp while fishing 205-225.
  collect 8365 x60 anywhere gather Fishing 225

step Bristle Whisker Catfish Top-Up
  tip Top up to Cooking 175 if needed before learning Mithril Headed Trout.
  craft 7755 "Bristle Whisker Catfish" until 175

step Cook Mithril Headed Trout (175-225)
  tip Cook Mithril Headed Trout to Cooking 225. Keep extra trout for 225-250 after Artisan Cooking.
  learn 20916 "Mithril Headed Trout"
  craft 20916 "Mithril Headed Trout" until 225

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Artisan

section Cooking 225-300

step Artisan Lead-Ins (Ironforge)
  only Alliance
  zone Ironforge
  tip Pick up both Artisan lead-in quests at skill 225 and level 35: Nat Pagle, Angler Extreme (Fishing) and I Know A Guy... (Cooking).
  skill Fishing 225
  skill Cooking 225
  level 35
  accept 6609
  accept 6612

step Artisan Lead-Ins (Orgrimmar)
  only Horde
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Pick up both Artisan lead-in quests at skill 225 and level 35: Nat Pagle, Angler Extreme (Fishing) and To Gadgetzan You Go! (Cooking).
  skill Fishing 225
  skill Cooking 225
  level 35
  accept 6608
  accept 6611

step Nat Pagle, Angler Extreme
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip Swim to Nat Pagle's island off the southeast coast of Dustwallow Marsh, turn in your lead-in, and accept Nat Pagle, Angler Extreme.
  turnin 6609 only Alliance
  turnin 6608 only Horde
  accept 6607

step Sar'theris Striker (Alliance)
  only Alliance
  zone Desolace
  tip Fish the northern Desolace coast for Sar'theris Striker. Keep any Raw Redgill bycatch for Cooking 250-285!
  collect 16968 quest 6607 @38.8,23.2

step Sar'theris Striker (Horde)
  only Horde
  zone Desolace
  tip Fish the Shadowprey Village coast for Sar'theris Striker. Keep any Raw Redgill bycatch for Cooking 250-285!
  collect 16968 quest 6607 @22.8,76.8

step Feralas Ahi
  zone Feralas
  tip Attach Bright Baubles (or an Aquadynamic Fish Attractor) and fish Verdantis River for Feralas Ahi.
  buy 6532 x2 nearest
  collect 16967 quest 6607 @63.7,52.4

step Savage Coast Blue Sailfin (Alliance)
  only Alliance
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip Fish the southern Savage Coast for Savage Coast Blue Sailfin. Keep Raw Redgill bycatch.
  collect 16969 quest 6607 @27.4,68.9

step Savage Coast Blue Sailfin (Horde)
  only Horde
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip Fish mid-coast away from Grom'gol for Savage Coast Blue Sailfin. Keep Raw Redgill bycatch.
  collect 16969 quest 6607 @25.3,45.2

step Misty Reed Mahi Mahi
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip Fish Misty Reed Strand for Misty Reed Mahi Mahi. Keep Raw Redgill bycatch.
  collect 16970 quest 6607 @75.1,95.9

step Artisan Fishing Turn-In and Swamp Trout to 255
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip Hand the four quest fish to Nat Pagle to unlock Artisan Fishing (cap 300), then fish the Dustwallow swamp to Fishing 255 for your remaining Raw Mithril Head Trout.
  turnin 6607
  goto 48.2,36.5 map 1445 "Dustwallow Marsh swamp" r 25
  skill Fishing 255

step Artisan Cooking Goods (Tanaris)
  zone Tanaris
  tip Gather 12 Giant Eggs from Tanaris Rocs, 10 Zesty Clam Meat from Steeljaw Snappers near Steamwheedle Port, and 20 Alterac Swiss from any food vendor.
  collect 12207 x12
  collect 7974 x10 @66.2,20.8
  buy 8932 x20 nearest

step Clamlette Surprise and Nightfin Soup Recipe
  zone Tanaris
  tip Turn in your lead-in and Clamlette Surprise to Dirge Quikcleave in Gadgetzan for Artisan Cooking (cap 300), then buy Recipe: Nightfin Soup from Gikkix in Steamwheedle Port.
  turnin 6612 only Alliance
  turnin 6611 only Horde
  accept 6610
  turnin 6610
  buy 13945 x1 npc 8137

step Mithril Headed Trout 225-250: Auction House
  tip Auction House fallback for 80 more Raw Mithril Head Trout.
  auction 8365 x80

step Mithril Headed Trout 225-250: Gather
  tip Caught in the Dustwallow Marsh swamp while fishing to 255.
  collect 8365 x80 anywhere gather Fishing 225

step Cook Mithril Headed Trout (225-250)
  tip Cook Mithril Headed Trout to Cooking 250.
  craft 20916 "Mithril Headed Trout" until 250

step Filet of Redgill: Auction House
  tip Auction House fallback for 55 Raw Redgill.
  auction 13758 x55

step Filet of Redgill: Gather
  tip Bycatch from the Nat Pagle coastal fishing stops (or from your bank).
  collect 13758 x55 anywhere gather Fishing 225

step Cook Filet of Redgill (250-285)
  tip Cook Filet of Redgill to Cooking 285 using the recipe bought in Booty Bay.
  learn 18241 "Filet of Redgill"
  craft 18241 "Filet of Redgill" until 285

step Fish to 300 in Feralas (Alliance)
  only Alliance
  zone Feralas
  tip Buy 12 Nightcrawlers from Vivianna in Feathermoon Stronghold and fish the Feralas lake to Fishing 300. Fish mornings, evenings, or nights (not 12:00-18:00 game time) to catch Raw Nightfin Snapper for your final Cooking stretch!
  buy 6530 x12 nearest
  goto 34.4,34.2 map 1444 "Feralas lake" r 25
  skill Fishing 300

step Fish to 300 in Feralas (Horde)
  only Horde
  zone Feralas
  tip Buy 12 Nightcrawlers from Sheendra Tallgrass in Camp Mojache and fish Verdantis River to Fishing 300. Fish mornings, evenings, or nights (not 12:00-18:00 game time) to catch Raw Nightfin Snapper for your final Cooking stretch!
  buy 6530 x12 nearest
  goto 63.7,52.4 map 1444 "Verdantis River" r 25
  skill Fishing 300

step Nightfin Soup: Water
  tip Buy 25 Refreshing Spring Water from any innkeeper.
  buy 159 x25 nearest

step Nightfin Soup: Auction House
  tip Auction House fallback for 25 Raw Nightfin Snapper.
  auction 13759 x25

step Nightfin Soup: Gather
  tip Caught in Feralas while finishing Fishing 255-300 outside 12:00-18:00 game time.
  collect 13759 x25 anywhere gather Fishing 255

step Cook Nightfin Soup (285-300)
  tip Cook Nightfin Soup to hit Cooking 300 — both Fishing and Cooking are now maxed at 300/300!
  learn 18243 "Nightfin Soup"
  craft 18243 "Nightfin Soup" until 300
